return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;','language'=>'oci','project-id-version'=>'babilim-0.1.0-oci-babilim-0.1.0-oci-20261030T031400','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:37+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:37+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Babilim'=>'Babilim','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Emplis las traduccions mancantas dels empeuts e dels tèmas ja installats sul vòstre site.','Translations'=>'Traduccions','Babilim Settings'=>'Paramètres de Babilim','Settings'=>'Paramètres','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Sètz pas autorizat a far aquò.','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Seleccionatz mens de compausants : al maximum %1$d operacions per execucion (n\'avètz seleccionat %2$d).','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Aqueste compausant es pas installat sus aqueste site, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','Already installed.'=>'Ja installat.','Downloaded and installed.'=>'Telecargat e installat.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim es pas encara activat per aqueste site.','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Cap de build es pas disponible per telecargar per aquesta lenga.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Retorn a la build precedenta.','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Retorn en arrièr e senhalat.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Retorn en arrièr, mas lo senhalament a pas pogut èsser enviat : %s','Removed.'=>'Suprimit.','Translation requested.'=>'Traduccion demandada.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Aqueste compausant es ja estat enviat. Babilim lo verifica ara.','Upload cancelled.'=>'Mandadís anullat.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Mandadís acabat — traduccion demandada.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Aqueste compausant declara pas de numèro de version, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Lo numèro de version d\'aqueste compausant es mai long que %d caractèrs, çò que Babilim pòt pas tractar, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per aquesta lenga sus aqueste site pel moment.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Mercé. Vòstre senhalament es estat enviat.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Aqueste rapòrt indica pas lo Nom d\'un empeut o d\'un tèma valid ni una lenga valida.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Causissètz una categoria per aqueste senhalament.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Aqueste senhalament manca d\'una build valida sus la quala se basar.','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Aquesta build es pas una que aqueste site conois actualament per aqueste compausant/aquesta lenga.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Lo camp « %1$s » es tròp long : a %2$d caractèrs e la limita es %3$d. Res es pas estat enviat ; mercé de l\'abreujar e tornar ensajar.','Original string'=>'Cadena d\'origina','String context'=>'Contèxte de la cadena','Current translation'=>'Traduccion actuala','Suggested translation'=>'Traduccion suggerida','Note (optional)'=>'Nòta (facultativa)','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'O ont l\'avètz vist (facultatiu)','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'La sincronizacion de Babilim es temporàriament retardada pel servici (limit de requèstas) ; tornarà ensajar aprèp %s.','The locale you added is not valid: use a WordPress locale code such as ll_CC (letters, digits, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'La lenga ajustada es pas valida : utilizatz un còde de lenga WordPress coma ll_CC (letras, chifras, jos-linhatge, tirat o @, al maximum %d caractèrs). Res es pas estat enregistrat.','Settings saved.'=>'Paramètres enregistrats.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Se活 aquesta opcion es activada, la desinstallacion escafa tanben l\'identitat del site. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poirà pas èsser restaurada automaticament aprèp; vos caldriá contactar l\'Assisténcia Babilim a %s per la recuperar.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim es configurat per escafar l\'identitat d\'aqueste site quand l\'empeut es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; vos caldriá contactar l\'Assisténcia Babilim a %s. Per gardar l\'identitat, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres de Babilim, e desactivatz tornamai. Desactivar malgrat tot ?','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'%1$d site d\'aquesta ret es configurat per escafar sa identitat Babilim quand l\'empeut es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; vos caldriá contactar l\'Assisténcia Babilim a %2$s. Per gardar l\'identitat, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres de Babilim d\'aqueste site, e desactivatz tornamai. Desactivar malgrat tot ?' . "\0" . '%1$d sites d\'aquesta ret son configurats per escafar lor identitat Babilim quand l\'empeut es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueles sites poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; vos caldriá contactar l\'Assisténcia Babilim a %2$s. Per gardar las identitats, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres de Babilim de cada site, e desactivatz tornamai. Desactivar malgrat tot ?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Aqueste malhum a tròp de sits per los verificar un per un, e unes d\'entre eles pòdon èsser configurats per escafar lor identitat Babilim quand lo plugin es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a un tal sit poiriá puèi pas èsser restaurada automaticament ; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia Babilim a %s. Per gardar las identitats, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres de Babilim de cada sit, e desactivatz tornamai. Desactivar aital ?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Dobrir los paramètres de Babilim','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut verificar aqueste sit, doncas res es pas telecargat ni installat.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Lo servici a pas pogut jónher vòstre sit. Un parafuòc, un plugin de seguretat o una règla de l\'albergador blòca probablament la requèsta ; autorizatz las requèstas cap a /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Vòstre sit a mes tròp de temps a respondre. Tornatz ensajar mai tard e verificatz que vòstre servidor d\'albergament siá pas tròp lent o subrecargat.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Vòstre sit a respondut, mas pas çò qu\'èra esperat. L\'API REST es benlèu reescrita per un autre plugin, o aquel endpoint es benlèu en escondedor ; excludissètz /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge de l\'escondedor e de la reescritura.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Verificatz que vòstre sit siá accessible dempuèi Internet, puèi tornatz ensajar.','Re-verify'=>'Tornar verificar','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Aqueste sit depassa la talha que lo servici accepta en una sola sincronizacion, doncas unes elements son estats daissats de caire : %1$d components e %2$d lengas.','This site is verified.'=>'Aqueste sit es verificat.','Registration restarted.'=>'Inscripcion tornada començar.','Sync complete.'=>'Sincronizacion acabada.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the 