ament de la partida %1$d sus %2$d…','Continue'=>'Contunhar','Confirm'=>'Confirmar','Remove'=>'Suprimir','Roll back'=>'Tornar en arrièr','Nothing to confirm.'=>'I a pas res de confirmar.','Choose a language'=>'Causir una lenga','Roll back and report'=>'Tornar en arrièr e senhalar','Report a problem'=>'Senhalar un problèma','Nothing to choose.'=>'I a pas res de causir.','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s : %2$s. Causissètz la lenga.','Supplementary translations'=>'Traduccions suplementàrias','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'La contribucion pròpria de cada component al supplement del domeni default partejat de cada lengua.','Component'=>'Component','Language'=>'Lenga','Included in index'=>'Inclús dins l\'indèx','Entries'=>'Entradas','Conflicting keys'=>'Claus en conflicte','Yes'=>'Òc','No — component inactive'=>'Non — compausant inactiu','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Non — la version installada es diferenta de l\'activa','No — component removed'=>'Non — compausant suprimit','No'=>'Non','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Sonque un administrator de la ret pòt far aquò, perque aquò modifica de fichièrs de traduccion partejats per totes los sites d\'aquesta ret.','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut acabar la verificacion d\'aqueste site (lo servici a pas pogut lo recontactar). L\'enregistrament es en pausa.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Aqueste site a ja un enregistrament actiu que pòt plus èstre recuperat automaticament.','Restart registration'=>'Tornar començar l\'enregistrament','Babilim settings'=>'Paramètres de Babilim','General'=>'General','Advanced'=>'Avançat','Languages'=>'Lengas','Automatic installs'=>'Installacions automaticas','Install available translations automatically'=>'Installar automaticament las traduccions disponiblas','On the free plan, only components that already use one of your free slots are installed automatically, so no new slot is taken.'=>'Amb lo plan gratuit, sonque los compausants que utilizan ja un dels vòstres emplaçaments liures son installats automaticament, doncas cap de novèl emplaçament es pas pres.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Aqueste site fa part d\'una ret multisite, que installa pas de novèlas traduccions automaticament. Las traduccions ja installadas son pasmens meses a jorn.','Custom overrides'=>'Subrecargaments personalizats','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Gardar mas pròprias subrecargaments de traduccion quand se purga tot o quand se desinstalla aqueste empeuton.','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Los fichièrs de traduccion que metètz dins %s an totjorn prioritat sus los de Babilim. Son gardats levat que desmarquetz aquesta casa.','Uninstall'=>'Desinstallar','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Desactivat per defaut : suprimir l\'empeuton garda l\'identitat del site, per que una reinstallacion la pòsca tornar utilizar.','Account'=>'Compte','Save changes'=>'Enregistrar las modificacions','Disable Babilim'=>'Desactivar Babilim','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Las traduccions installadas son gardadas, mas cap de verificacion ni de telecargament se lançarà pas.','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Desactivar Babilim ? Las traduccions installadas son gardadas, mas cap de verificacion ni de telecargament se lançarà pas.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Aqueste site es pas encara enregistrat amb Babilim.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Aqueste site es ja jos licéncia. Tornatz cargar la pagina.','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'La comanda es pas disponibla per aqueste site pel moment.','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'Impossible de lançar la comanda : %s','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim es pas activat.','Not registered yet'=>'Pas encara inscrich','Not verified'=>'Pas verificat','Verified'=>'Verificat','Status'=>'Estat','Licensed'=>'Amb licéncia','Partner'=>'Partenari','Free'=>'Gratuit','License'=>'Licéncia','Upgrade this site'=>'Metre a nivèl aqueste site','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Crompa unica per aqueste site : %1$s %2$s. Inclutz totas las actualizacions de traduccions a venir. Lo pagament es gerit per Paddle dins un onglet novèl.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Aquò emet un novèl còdi de restauracion e lo precedent s\'arrèta de foncionar. Contunhar ?','Show a new restore code'=>'Mostrar un novèl còdi de restauracion','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore code'=>'Còdi de restauracion','Restore purchase'=>'Restaurar la crompa','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Avètz ja crompat una licéncia per aqueste domeni ? Picatz lo còdi de restauracion recebut a la comanda.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Aquò sembla pas un còdi de restauracion.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Aqueste còdi de restauracion es pas reconegut per aqueste site.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Tròp de ensages. Tornatz ensajar deman.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Aqueste site deu èstre verificat d\'en primièr.','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'Impossible de restaurar la crompa : %s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Crompa restaurada. Aqueste site a ara una licéncia.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Aqueste site a pas cap de crompa per mostrar un còdi.','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'Impossible de mostrar un novèl còdi de restauracion : %s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Vòstre novèl còdi de restauracion : %s. Gardatz-lo en lòc segur — lo còdi precedent fonciona pas mai.','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Çò qu\'es mandat quand Babilim verifica aqueste site','(detected)'=>'(detectat)','No language is managed yet.'=>'Cap de lenga es pas encara gerida.','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim ajusta de traduccions per cada lenga marcada aicí.','Add another language'=>'Ajustar una autra lenga','Choose a language…'=>'Causir una lenga…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Impossible de cargar la lista completa de las lengas de WordPress.org dempuèi lo servici, doncas cap d\'autra lenga pòt pas èstre ajustada pel moment.','Theme'=>'Tèma','Plugin'=>'Extension','Free quota'=>'Quòta gratuita','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Telecargaments : %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'Indèx suplementari de traduccions','Built'=>'Generat','Included'=>'Inclús','Excluded'=>'Exclús','Already in WordPress core'=>'Ja dins lo nuclèu de WordPress','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Mantenença de l\'indèx suplementari de traduccions','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'L\'estat de la mantenença es pas disponible pel moment.','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Un netejatge es estat mes en pausa lo %1$s : %2$s. Res es pas estat suprimit.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Darrièr netejatge lo %1$s : %2$d novèlament marcat(s), %3$d fichièr(s) suprimit(s), %4$d enregistrament(s) levat(s).','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Cap de netejatge s\'es pas encara executat.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'Una escritura de l\'indèx de traduccions a entrat en conflicte amb una autra requèsta lo %1$s (%2$s) e es pas estada aplicada; la version la mai recenta es estada gardada.','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'Una escritura de l\'indèx de traduccions lo %1$s (%2$s) a pas pogut s\'acabar e es pas estada aplicada (%3$s).','Maintenance'=>'Mantenença','Rebuild index now'=>'Tornar bastir l\'indèx ara','Sweep now'=>'Netejar ara','Danger zone'=>'Zòna perilhosa','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Suprimís totes los fichièrs de lenga qu\'a installats Babilim per cada extension e tèma d\'aqueste site.','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Suprimir tot çò qu\'a installat Babilim ? Aquò suprimís totes los fichièrs de lenga qu\'a installats per cada extension e tèma d\'aqueste site.','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Suprimir tot çò qu\'a installat Babilim','This string is too long to be sent as a report, so no report form is offered for it.'=>'Aquesta cadena es tròp longa per èsser enviada coma rapòrt, doncas cap de formulari de rapòrt es pas prepausat.','Category'=>'Categoria','Choose a category…'=>'Causir una categoria…','Roll back and send report'=>'Tornar en arrièr e enviar un rapòrt','Send report'=>'Enviar un rapòrt','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Una part del tèxte d\'aqueste component es escrita en dur pel sieu autor e pòt pas èsser traduita per un paquet de lenga.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Bundled with the theme'=>'Inclús dins lo tèma','Bundled with the plugin'=>'Inclús dins l\'extension','Upload was not accepted'=>'Lo mandadís es estat refusat','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Lo mandadís a expirat abans d\'acabar','No translation'=>'Cap de traduccion','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Mandadís en cors — contunhar o anullar','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Planificat, en espèra de tractament','Translating…'=>'Traduccion en cors…','Translation failed'=>'La traduccion a fracassat','Free quota used'=>'Quòta gratuita utilizada','Needs a paid license'=>'Necessita una licéncia pagada','Not supported'=>'Pas pres en carga','Status unknown'=>'Estat desconegut','translation statusInstalled'=>'Installat','Update available'=>'Actualizacion disponibla','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Levat aprèp un fracàs de la verificacion d\'integritat','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s, version novèla planificada','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta, version novèla planificada','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s, traduccion de la version novèla en cors…','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta, traduccion de la version novèla en cors…','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Installat · bastit per a %1$s, aqueste site a %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Installada · bastida per a %s, la version novèla a fracassat','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Installada · bastida per a una version diferenta, la version novèla a fracassat','Installed · built for %s, new version needs a paid license'=>'Installada · bastida per a %s, la version novèla requerís una licéncia pagada','Installed · built for a different version, new version needs a paid license'=>'Installada · bastida per a una version diferenta, la version novèla requerís una licéncia pagada','Installed · built for %s, free quota used'=>'Installada · bastida per a %s, quòta gratuita utilizada','Installed · built for a different version, free quota used'=>'Installada · bastida per a una version diferenta, quòta gratuita utilizada','translation statusAvailable'=>'Disponibla','Installed · %s'=>'Installada · %s','Available · %s'=>'Disponibla · %s','Update'=>'Metre a jorn','Download'=>'Telecargar','Updating…'=>'Mesa a jorn…','Downloading…'=>'Telecargament…','Retry request'=>'Tornar ensajar la demanda','Request newer translation'=>'Demandar una traduccion mai recenta','Request translation'=>'Demandar una traduccion','Requesting…'=>'Demanda…','Requesting a translation uses one of your free slots, unless this component already uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back.'=>'Demandar una traduccion utiliza un de vòstres emplaçaments liures, levat que aqueste compausant ne utilize ja un. Una traduccion fracassada rend pas l\'emplaçament.','If this component does not use one of your free slots yet, requesting a translation uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back. Continue?'=>'Se aqueste compausant utiliza pas encara un de vòstres emplaçaments liures, demandar una traduccion ne utiliza un. Una traduccion fracassada rend pas l\'emplaçament. Contunhar ?','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Cap d\'extension o de tèma pas trobat.','Clear filters'=>'Escafar los filtres','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Cap de compausant correspond pas a aquestes filtres. %s','Select all'=>'Tot seleccionar','All'=>'Tot','Available'=>'Disponibla','Updates'=>'Mesas a jorn','Requestable'=>'Se pòt demandar','Installed'=>'Installada','Plugins'=>'Extensions','Themes'=>'Tèmas','All languages'=>'Totas las lengas','%d to install'=>'%d d\'installar' . "\0" . '%d d\'installar','Language:'=>'Lenga :','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Las accions en gropa s\'aplican a cada lenga correspondenta de cada compausant seleccionat.','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Las accions en gropa s\'aplican pas qu\'a la lenga seleccionada de cada compausant seleccionat.','Version %s'=>'Version %s','Theme · %s'=>'Tèma · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'Extension · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Suprimir la traduccion %2$s de %1$s d\'aqueste site ?','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'Restablir la build precedenta de la traduccion en %2$s de %1$s ?','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s : %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s : %2$s (%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Lo desfís d\'enregistrament es pas dins la forma esperada.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Aquò es pas un identificant de build valid.','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Refús d\'escriure fòra del repertòri dels fichièrs de lenga de Babilim.','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Impossible d\'escriure lo paquet telecargat sul disc.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Responsa HTTP %d imprevista.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'L\'URL d\'aqueste site, per que lo servici pòsca verificar que ne sètz lo proprietari.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Vòstra version de WordPress, per provesir de fichièrs de traduccion compatibles.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Vòstra version de PHP, per la compatibilitat.','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'La version d\'aqueste empeuton, per que lo servici vos pòsca dire de lo metre a jorn s\'es tròp ancian per comunicar.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'La lenga configurada d\'aqueste site.','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'Totas las lengas en usatge sus aqueste site (lenga del site, paquets de lenga installats, lengas dels utilizaires e las que ajustatz manualament). Cap de lenga es pas tractada diferentament d\'una autra.','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(una clau publica generada per aqueste site)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'La clau publica d\'installacion d\'aqueste site, utilizada per provar que las demandas venon vertadièrament d\'aqueste site. Sonque la partida publica es enviada.','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'Cada empeuton o tèma installat : son slug, sa version, son/sos domeni(s) de traduccion, se figura sus WordPress.org, sas lengas integradas e las lengas per las qualas avètz ja installat una traduccion Babilim.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'Solament quand confirmatz un enviament per un empeuton o un tèma que es pas sus WordPress.org : tot lo repertòri d\'aqueste component, en zip.','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(solament de còdis e de coordenadas generics)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Fins a 20 eveniments de diagnostic en espèra (ex. un fichièr que a fracassat a sa verificacion d\'integritat), cadun amb sonque un còdi, un component e una lenga, e jamai cap de contengut de cadena ni de tèxte traduch.','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Lenga pas segura : %s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest indisponible : %s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Impossible de determinar los components actius ; l\'indèx fusionat existent es pas estat modificat.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'Impossible de determinar los empeutons/tèmas installats ; netejatge ignorat, res es pas estat suprimit.','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Netejatge abandonat sens daissar cap d\'orfanèl : %s.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Lo netejatge s\'es executat, mas unas de sas modificacions an pas pogut èsser enregistradas dins l\'indèx de traduccions ; lo netejatge seguent las tornarà ensajar.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'L\'indèx fusionat de \'%s\' es estat reconstruch, mas l\'indèx de traduccions l\'a pas pogut enregistrar ; la reconstruccion seguenta tornarà ensajar.','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'Impossible d\'escriure l\'indèx fusionat preparat.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Lo nombre d\'entradas tornadas a analisar correspond pas a l\'indèx bastit.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'Impossible de desplaçar l\'indèx fusionat de \'%s\' a sa plaça ; l\'indèx servit precedent (s\'i n\'aviá un) es estat suprimit puslèu que daissat parcialament mes a jorn. Cap de suplement del domeni default serà pas servit per aquesta lenga fins a la reconstruccion capitada seguenta.','Could not open zip: %s'=>'Impossible de dobrir lo zip : %s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Lo zip a pas de manifest.json.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'Lo manifest.json del zip es pas un JSON valid.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'Lo camp \'%s\' de manifest.json correspond pas a la valor esperada.','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Una autra installacion es en cors ; tornatz ensajar d\'aquí un moment.','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Es pas un server_build_id valid : %s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Lo kind \'%1$s\' del manifest del paquet correspond pas al kind demandat \'%2$s\'.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Lo domeni de traduccion del paquet \'%1$s\' correspond pas a la còpia d\'aqueste site del component (\'%2$s\'), doncas es pas estat installat.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Lo domeni donat \'%1$s\' correspond ni al slug pròpri del manifest del paquet \'%2$s\' ni a son text_domain \'%3$s\'.','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug pas segur : %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain pas segur : %s','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Lo paquet a pas cap de %s pel sieu pròpri domeni de tèxte.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json manca o a un \'%s\' invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json manca o a un \'entries\' invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json manca o a un \'files\' invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json manca o a un \'extra_domains\' invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json manca o a un \'build_no\' invalid.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Lo \'server_build_id\' de manifest.json es pas un identificant de build valid.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'Lo \'contract\' de manifest.json es pas una cadena de version valida.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'Lo \'status\' de manifest.json deu èsser \'published\'.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'Lo camp \'kind\' de manifest.json deu èsser \'plugin\' o \'theme\'.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json a un \'default_domain_entries\' invalid.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json a un \'default_domain_files\' invalid.','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest manca o a un \'%s\' invalid.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Lo \'server_build_id\' de expected_manifest es pas un identificant de build valid.','No record for %s'=>'Cap d\'enregistrament per %s','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Un o mantun fichièr servit correspondon pas mai al manifest.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Cap de build precedent ont tornar en arrièr.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Lo cambiament a pas pogut èsser enregistrat dins l\'indèx de traduccions; tornatz ensajar.','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Genre desconegut : %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Domeni pas segur : %s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Lo domeni de tèxte \'%1$s\' (%2$s) es ja servit per un autre compausant installat (%3$s); res es pas estat installat.','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Tornar en arrièr remplaçariá \'%1$s\' (%2$s), qu\'es ara servit per un autre compausant installat (%3$s); res es pas estat cambiat.','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Al zip li manca un fichièr esperat : %s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'Marrit sha256 per %s','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Lo paquet declara pas cap de fichièr de traduccion principal.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Al zip li manca un fichièr per defaut esperat : %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'Marrit sha256 per default/%s','Could not stage %s'=>'Impossible de preparar %s','Could not stage default/%s'=>'Impossible de preparar default/%s','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Nombre d\'entradas diferent per %s','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'Impossible de verificar lo nombre d\'entradas per %s','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Nombre d\'entradas l10n.php diferent per %s','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'Nombre d\'entradas del supplement per defaut diferent.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Lo paquet a pas produch cap de fichièr de traduccion principal servible.','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'Impossible de preparar %s per tornar en arrièr.','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'Impossible de salvar %s abans de lo remplaçar.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'Impossible de desplaçar %s a sa plaça.','English (United States)'=>'Anglés (Estats Units)','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest es pas disponible : %s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'impossible de legir _manifest.json : %s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Fracàs de l\'analisi de _manifest.json : %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json a una estructura imprevista','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Impossible de crear l\'archiu del paquet.','No writable temporary directory is available for packaging.'=>'Cap de repertòri temporari inscriptible es pas disponible per empaquetar.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Un fichièr del compausant a pas pogut èstre legit, doncas es pas estat empaquetat.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Sols los empeutons e los tèmas pòdon èstre empaquetats.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Lo fichièr principal del compausant es pas estat trobat.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Lo compausant es pas dins lo repertòri dels empeutons o dels tèmas.','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim a agotat lo temps disponible per aquesta etapa e contunharà a la verificacion seguenta.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut verificar aqueste site, doncas res es pas telecargat ni installat tant que la verificacion capita pas.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Mancavan de camps obligatòris dins la responsa d\'enregistrament.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Cap de desfís en espèra a verificar.','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'A la responsa de verificacion li mancava site_token.','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Cap d\'identificant de site es pas gardat per renovelar un geton.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'A la responsa de renovelament del geton li mancava site_token.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce deu èstre una cadena exadecimala.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Cap de desfís en espèra per aqueste nonce.','Too many requests.'=>'Tròp de requèstas.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Aqueste site a %1$d compausants dins %2$d lengas, çò que necessita %3$d lòts de verificacion ; Babilim ne pòt tractar al mai %4$d per execucion. Redusissètz las lengas geridas dins los Paramètres o desactivatz los empeutons e tèmas inutilizats, puèi quichatz Tornar verificar ara.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut acabar la verificacion d\'aqueste site.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'L\'adreça d\'aqueste site es tròp longa per que Babilim l\'enregistre.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Lo còdi de lenga d\'aqueste site es pas un que Babilim pòt enregistrar.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'A la responsa de telecargament li mancava un emplaçament utilizable.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'L\'ofèrta de mandadís del servici èra incompleta.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Aqueste compausant es mai gròs que çò que lo servici accepta, doncas pòt pas èstre mandat.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Lo compausant empaquetat a pas pogut èstre legit.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Una part del mandadís a fracassat mantun còp, doncas lo mandadís es estat anullat.','Could not read: %s'=>'Lectura impossibla : %s']];